     [ 3.  +0.j   -0.59+1.66j  0.09-0.55j  0.09+0.55j -0.59-1.66j]]

    When ``n=3`` and ``axis=0``, dimension of the transform along ``axis 0`` will
    be ``3`` and dimension along other axes will be same as that of input.

